@CampusQuest.API_HostAddress = https://localhost:7168

### 1. Register a New User
POST {{CampusQuest.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "gaye_quest",
  "email": "gaye@edu.com",
  "password": "SuperSecretPassword123!"
}

###

### 2. Login with Created User
POST {{CampusQuest.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "gaye@edu.com",
  "password": "SuperSecretPassword123!"
}